@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state AdminChoice <<choice>>
state EditorChoice <<choice>>
state ReadFeedbackChoice <<choice>>
state EndJoin <<choice>>

[*] --> StartChoice
StartChoice --> Register
StartChoice --> Login

Register --> AdminChoice
Login --> EditorChoice

AdminChoice --> ManageProfiles
AdminChoice --> InvalidUser
ManageProfiles --> Publishing
InvalidUser --> [*]

EditorChoice --> Writing
EditorChoice --> Editing
EditorChoice --> InvalidUser
Writing --> Editing
Editing --> Publishing

Publishing --> Reading
Reading --> Reading

Search --> Search
Reading --> ReadFeedbackChoice
ReadFeedbackChoice --> Feedback
Feedback --> EndJoin

EndJoin --> [*]

state Admin <<extends ManageProfiles>>
Admin : do / Manage profile in database
Admin : do / Add, delete or edit profiles if necessary
Admin : exit / Action completed

state Editor <<extends Writing & Editing>>
Editor : entry / Writer logged in
Editor : do / Write article
Editor : exit / Send to editor

state Reader <<extends Reading>>
Reader : entry / Published article
Reader : do / Read article
Reader : exit / Completed reading

@enduml
